<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Stantronic says in talks.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Stantronic says in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African electrical and refrigeration company Stantronic Ltd, which listed earlier this month, said it was in talks which could effect its share price.</p>
<p>The firm said in a brief statement that shareholders should exercise caution when dealing in its shares until a further announcement is made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
